  "body": "## Highlights\n\n* The `timoni build`, `timoni bundle build` and `timoni bundle apply` commands validate custom resources against their CRD schemas and CEL rules, see [bundle validation](https://timoni.sh/bundle/#validation).\n* The `timoni bundle vet --offline` command validates bundles with Runtime values from environment variables, without connecting to the clusters, see [runtime values](https://timoni.sh/bundle-runtime/#using-values-from-environment-variables).\n* Custom health checks fail fast on evaluation errors, and the [health check library](https://timoni.sh/cue/module/health-checks/#the-health-check-library) now covers the Gateway API `XBackend` kind.\n* The release assets include a signed [packslip](https://packslip.dev) for verifying the downloaded binaries.\n* Timoni is now built with Kubernetes 1.37.\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(mod): tolerate conditional config field in `mod vet` by @stefanprodan in https://github.com/stefanprodan/timoni/pull/646\n* feat(bundle): add `--offline` flag to `bundle vet` by @stefanprodan in https://github.com/stefanprodan/timoni/pull/647\n* feat(bundle): validate custom resources with CRD schema + CEL by @stefanprodan in https://github.com/stefanprodan/timoni/pull/648\n* fix(runtime): fail fast on health check schema errors by @stefanprodan in https://github.com/stefanprodan/timoni/pull/649\n* build(deps): bump google.golang.org/grpc from 1.83.0 to 1.83.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/stefanprodan/timoni/pull/651\n* build(deps): bump google.golang.org/grpc from 1.83.1 to 1.83.2 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/stefanprodan/timoni/pull/653\n* fix: remove trailing c-directives-end marker from timoni build YAML output by @kormide in https://github.com/stefanprodan/timoni/pull/657\n* ci(release): Publish a signed packslip by @jdx in https://github.com/stefanprodan/timoni/pull/659\n* build(deps): bump the ci group across 1 directory with 6 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/stefanprodan/timoni/pull/658\n* Update dependencies to Kubernetes v1.37.1 by @stefanprodan in https://github.com/stefanprodan/timoni/pull/660\n* Update blueprint schemas to Kubernetes 1.37 by @stefanprodan in https://github.com/stefanprodan/timoni/pull/661\n\n## New Contributors\n* @kormide made their first contribution in https://github.com/stefanprodan/timoni/pull/657\n* @jdx made their first contribution in https://github.com/stefanprodan/timoni/pull/659\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/stefanprodan/timoni/compare/v0.34.0...v0.35.0\n\n\n",
